{"path":"/case-studies/blueflame-ai/","slug":"case-studies__blueflame-ai","kind":"case-study","title":"Blueflame AI Case Study: A website Blueflame’s marketing team can manage | Legency Media","description":"Blueflame AI builds agentic AI for investment firms: private equity houses, hedge funds and investment banks. The first job we took on was a small one. A template that kept breaking, and a marketing team that had stopped editing the site in case it broke further.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/_slug_.CjSPQXea.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"cs-hero\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container cs-hero__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"cs-hero__lead\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Case Study</span><span class=\"cs-hero__client\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><img class=\"cs-hero__logo\" src=\"/img/partners/blueflame-2026.svg\" alt=\"Blueflame AI\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y></span><h1 class=\"cs-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>A website Blueflame’s marketing team can manage</h1><aside class=\"side-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"side-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h2 data-no-roll class=\"side-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Marketing owns page creation</h2><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"side-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Blueflame’s marketing team can create and edit pages using a reusable Webflow component system. Legency maintains the underlying development and supports technical changes, giving the team a way to keep its website current through an acquisition and rebrand.</p></aside></div><figure class=\"cs-hero__media\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><img class=\"case-visual\" src=\"/img/case-studies/blueflame-photo-oct2026-1440.webp\" srcset=\"/img/case-studies/blueflame-photo-oct2026-800.webp 800w, /img/case-studies/blueflame-photo-oct2026-1440.webp 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 94vw, 45vw\" alt=\"Blueflame AI homepage on an Apple Studio Display on a walnut desk overlooking a city.\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1008\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-iavcwzwr><figcaption data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Blueflame AI. Webflow development, reusable components and ongoing support.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"challenge\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container challenge__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Challenge</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"challenge__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The template kept breaking, so the team stopped touching it.</h2></div><div class=\"challenge__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Blueflame AI builds agentic AI for investment firms: private equity houses, hedge funds and investment banks. The first job we took on was a small one. A template that kept breaking, and a marketing team that had stopped editing the site in case it broke further.</p><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The work continued through a full redesign, the Datasite acquisition in July 2025, a Webflow Enterprise upgrade in January 2026 and a rebrand onto a new domain. Each change brought new website priorities.</p><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Selling into private equity and investment banking raises the bar again. Those buyers run their own diligence before they agree to a call, so the credentials the company already held had to sit where a buyer looks rather than wait to be searched for.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"solution section\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container solution__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"solution__lead\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Solution</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"solution__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Reusable pages with ongoing technical support</h2></div><div class=\"solution__cards\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Webflow Enterprise, Set Up Properly</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M6 6L18 6\"/><path d=\"M6 10H18\"/><path d=\"M13 14L18 14\"/><path d=\"M13 18L18 18\"/><path d=\"M2 21.4V2.6C2 2.26863 2.26863 2 2.6 2H21.4C21.7314 2 22 2.26863 22 2.6V21.4C22 21.7314 21.7314 22 21.4 22H2.6C2.26863 22 2 21.7314 2 21.4Z\"/><path d=\"M6 18V14H9V18H6Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The site moved onto the Webflow Enterprise plan in January 2026, with Optimize and Analyze switched on. Publishing a high-traffic enterprise site stays a deliberate human step: every CMS change we make is staged or drafted first, and the client team publishes.</p></article><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>A Component System Marketing Owns</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Pages are assembled from a component library we built once and have extended ever since. The marketing team builds and edits without a developer in the loop, using page branching so the work happens safely on a live enterprise site.</p></article><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Instrumentation Checked, Not Assumed</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The measurement layer gets audited the same way the site does. Search Console was pointed at a hostname nobody lands on. Three of four conversion actions had recorded nothing for thirteen weeks. Eleven standing permissions were letting the ad platform change bidding on its own. All three were found and closed.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"outcome\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"outcome__head\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Outcome</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"outcome__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Marketing can manage the website</h2></div><div class=\"outcome__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Page creation belongs to marketing</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The team can assemble and edit pages from the component library. Routine content work happens within that system, while Legency handles development and technical changes. This gives marketing a practical way to keep the site aligned with its campaigns and product messaging.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The website supported an acquisition and rebrand</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 20H4V4\"/><path d=\"M4 16.5L12 9L15 12L19.5 7.5\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The same working relationship continued through the Datasite acquisition, a redesign, an Enterprise upgrade and a domain move. The component system was extended as the company’s requirements changed, with ongoing development support around the marketing team.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Organic search visits grew over the longer term</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M8.5 11.5L11.5 14.5L16.5 9.5\"/><path d=\"M5 18L3.13036 4.91253C3.05646 4.39524 3.39389 3.91247 3.90398 3.79912L11.5661 2.09641C11.8519 2.03291 12.1481 2.03291 12.4339 2.09641L20.096 3.79912C20.6061 3.91247 20.9435 4.39524 20.8696 4.91252L19 18C18.9293 18.495 18.5 21.5 12 21.5C5.5 21.5 5.07071 18.495 5 18Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Google Analytics recorded 7,574 organic search sessions from 1 September to 29 November 2024 and 13,388 from 3 June to 31 August 2026, an increase of 77% across equal 90-day periods. This measures production-site visits. Traffic subsequently declined from its July 2025 peak; the historical comparison does not establish growth in enquiries or revenue, or isolate the effect of Legency’s work.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Lighter pages on mobile</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M13 10V3L5 14H11V21L19 10H13Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>During the 13 February 2026 performance work, measured page weight fell from 2,458KB to 1,231KB. The Lighthouse mobile Performance score rose from 36 to 72. These are dated lab measurements; they show reduced page weight and a higher test score, without establishing a sales uplift.</p></article></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".cs-hero .label,.challenge .label,.solution .label,.work-hero .label{color:#625e5e}.site-footer .closer__scene{filter:grayscale()}.case-visual[data-astro-cid-iavcwzwr]{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n.icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);height:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);background:var(--blue);color:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);flex-shrink:0;place-items:center;display:grid}.icon-chip--on-dark[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{background:#ffffff1a;border:1px solid #ffffff47}.icon-chip--bare[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{color:inherit;background:0 0;border:0}.icon-chip--muted[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{color:#201d1d8c;background:#201d1d0f;border:1px solid #201d1d1a}.icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga] svg[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:58%;height:58%;display:block}.icon-chip--bare[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga] svg[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:100%;height:100%}","html.lenis,html.lenis body{height:auto}.lenis:not(.lenis-autoToggle).lenis-stopped{overflow:clip}.lenis [data-lenis-prevent],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-wheel],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-touch],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-vertical],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-horizontal]{overscroll-behavior:contain}.lenis.lenis-smooth iframe{pointer-events:none}.lenis.lenis-autoToggle{transition-behavior:allow-discrete;transition-property:overflow;transition-duration:1ms}"]}